Workbench path-boundary cleanup.

- Keep the browser port-proxy URL root-relative even though the workbench is
  mounted below /ide. COMPOSERY_PROXY_URI remains the supported override; the
  image's VSCODE_PROXY_URI supplies the uniform default.
- Remove domainProxy. Composery never configures --proxy-domain; root path
  proxies are the supported boundary.
- Remove the dead /vscode duplicate workbench mount from Coder v1.

